---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = baseUrl.endsWith("/") ? baseUrl : `${baseUrl}/`;
---

<section class="hero-section container">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>
      <span class="title-main">もっと住みやすい</span>
      <span class="title-accent">高槻へ</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-description">
      データと現場経験をもとに、高槻市の政策を考え、<br class="pc-br" />市民の皆さまとともにつくる政策プラットフォームです。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href={`${base}policy/`} class="btn btn-primary">政策を見る</a>
      <a href={`${base}contact/`} class="btn btn-secondary">ご意見はこちら</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.hero-section {
  text-align: center !important;
  padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  padding-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
}

.hero-content {
  max-width: 980px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center !important;
}

.hero-content h1 {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: baseline;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.15em;
  margin: 0;
  text-align: center !important;
  font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 8rem);
  line-height: 0.96;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
}

.title-main,
.title-accent {
  display: inline-block;
}

.title-main {
  color: #ffffff;
  text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
}

.title-accent {
  color: #7cd7ff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(124, 215, 255, 0.4);
}

.hero-description {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 1.75rem auto 2rem;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  text-align: center !important;
  word-break: normal;
  overflow-wrap: break-word;
}

.pc-br {
  display: none;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .pc-br {
    display: inline;
  }
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .hero-content h1 {
    gap: 0.08em;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 14vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  .title-main,
  .title-accent {
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
}
</style>